              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa lieemanga, yasunganga mbu E OMWAMI, okalushile abaIsiraeli bano, ebikhumila likhumi akhandi eshikhumila.",
